# Learn more https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files

# dependencies
node_modules/
# the slash-less form too: a SYMLINKED node_modules is a file to git, and
# `node_modules/` (directory pattern) does not match it — git add -A takes it
node_modules

